  "summary": "A valid course order that always picks the smallest available course.",
  "statement": "Courses are `0..n-1`; `[a, b]` in `prereqs` means `b` must come before `a`. Return the lexicographically\nsmallest order that takes every course, or an empty array if it's impossible.",
